{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037120/extras/c1a893a0fc2b4b8ef3cecf1e2c21f254.avif?t=1747205829\" width=555 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mercenaries of War</strong> is a modern hardcore crime based PvP MMO with permanent death and legacy system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mercenaries of War was originally created with one thing in mind; create a positive hardcore PvP game environment with full development transparency and be actively involved in the player community to create the ultimate hardcore experience together.<br><br>Start off doing small crimes and illegal activities and earn your rep. Stock up on bullets and grab a gun to protect yourself. Participate in many activities such as group heists, hit the casinos, buy a property and make money off other players. <br><br>Make some allies and form a crew. If the Boss and Underboss of a crew dies, the crew is taken out and all remaining members dropped. Getting ready for a crew war? Crew management can distribute bullets to all members to ready for war. Permanent death is ruthless and Mercenaries are always hunting. Be careful out there.<br><br>Will you come out on top or will you be left 6 feet under? Decide your legacy.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3037120?t=1747205829","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037120/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747205829","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037120/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747205829","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037120/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747205829","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3037120/extras/c1a893a0fc2b4b8ef3cecf1e2c21f254.avif?t=1747205829\" width=555 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mercenaries of War</strong> is a modern hardcore crime based PvP MMO with permanent death and legacy system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mercenaries of War was originally created with one thing in mind; create a positive hardcore PvP game environment with full development transparency and be actively involved in the player community to create the ultimate hardcore experience together.<br><br>Start off doing small crimes and illegal activities and earn your rep. Stock up on bullets and grab a gun to protect yourself. Participate in many activities such as group heists, hit the casinos, buy a property and make money off other players. <br><br>Make some allies and form a crew. If the Boss and Underboss of a crew dies, the crew is taken out and all remaining members dropped. Getting ready for a crew war? Crew management can distribute bullets to all members to ready for war. Permanent death is ruthless and Mercenaries are always hunting. Be careful out there.<br><br>Will you come out on top or will you be left 6 feet under? Decide your legacy.</p>","developers":["Vyndictus"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Mercenaries of War ","genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/